<title>USA: Manassas, Va., $10.200 mln won by Davenport &amp; Co..</title>
<headline>Manassas, Va., $10.200 mln won by Davenport &amp; Co..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Davenport &amp; Co. said it won $10.200 million of Manassas, Va., general obligation AMT bonds, Series 1996 B, with a true interest cost of 5.58 percent.</p>
</text>
